        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "A Septuagesima usque ad Pascha, loco Alleluia dicitur: Laus tibi, Domine, Rex aeternae gloriae.",
          "english": "From Septuagesima until Easter, instead of Alleluia is said: Praise be to Thee, O Lord, King of everlasting glory.",
          "sourcePages": [
            90
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "prepared",
            "preparedFor": "Sacrum Florilegium",
